			"notes": "# Changes\n\n- Added 30 new, custom advancements for milestones within the mod\n- Adjusted/supplemented missing/incorrect language entries\n<details>\n<summary><b>🏆 Advancements</b></summary>\n\n#### 💚 Emeralds Plus\n\nThe start of something different\n\n---\n\n#### 🔨 A Greener Future\n\nObtain an Emerald Upgrade\n\n---\n\n#### 📚 Duper\n\nDuplicate an Emerald Upgrade\n\n---\n\n#### 💎 More than diamonds\n\nUpgrade something to Emerald level\n\n---\n\n#### ⚔️ A Precious Weapon\n\nObtain an Emerald Sword\n\n---\n\n#### 🪓 A Cut Above\n\nObtain an Emerald Axe\n\n---\n\n#### ⛏️ Isn't it Emerald Pick?\n\nObtain an Emerald Pickaxe\n\n---\n\n#### ⚒️ Digging for Riches\n\nObtain an Emerald Shovel\n\n---\n\n#### 🌾 A Greener Thumb\n\nObtain an Emerald Hoe\n\n---\n\n#### 👗 Dressed to Impress\n\nObtain your first Emerald Armor Piece\n\n---\n\n#### 🛡️ A Shiny Defense\n\nObtain an Emerald Shield\n\n---\n\n#### ⚔️ A better Iron Golem\n\nDamage an Villager enemie with Village Protector\n\n---\n\n#### 💰 A Good Business\n\nUse Trade Luck to get Hero of The Village\n\n---\n\n#### 🌲 Timber!\n\nUse Level 1 of Insta tree to mine a tree\n\n---\n\n#### 🌳 Timber! Again!\n\nUse Level 2 of Insta tree to mine a tree\n\n---\n\n#### 🌴 Forest? What Forest?\n\nUse Level 3 of Insta tree to mine a tree\n\n---\n\n#### ⚒️ One for the Whole Vein\n\nUse Vein-Miner to mine a whole vein\n\n---\n\n#### 🔥 Bake your Materials\n\nAuto smelt an item using Smelted\n\n---\n\n#### 🪨 Breaking the limits\n\nUse Multi-Break Level 1 to Mine 2 blocks at once\n\n---\n\n#### 🧱 Breaking Mastery\n\nUse Multi-Break Level 2 to Mine 4 blocks at once\n\n---\n\n#### 🛖 Expert Excavator\n\nUse Multi-Break Level 3 to Mine 9 blocks at once\n\n---\n\n#### 💣 Master of Destruction\n\nUse Multi-Break Level 4 to Mine 8 blocks at once\n\n---\n\n#### 🏔️ The Ultimate Breaker\n\nUse Multi-Break Level 5 to Mine 18 blocks at once\n\n---\n\n#### 🦴 Bone Appétit\n\nGet a bone using Fast Farm\n\n---\n\n#### 🪖 Cover Me in Emeralds\n\nObtain a full Emerald Armor\n\n---\n\n#### ⛓️ A heart out of iron\n\nProtect your body from the damage of an iron golem using golem protection\n\n---\n\n#### 🛡️ The New Iron Golem\n\nProtect your body from village enemies with Village Protection\n\n---\n\n#### 🪂 Not Today, Gravity!\n\nUse your Emerald Shield to block fall damage\n\n---\n\n#### 🪶 Feather Falling?\n\nBlock fall damage using the Feather Shield Enchantment\n\n---\n\n#### 🗃️ The Emerald Collection\n\nObtain every item of the Emeralds Plus Mod\n\n---\n</details>"
		},
